  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">讓可疑的沙子和礫石具有發光輪廓，以便更容易進行考古，並希望讓玩家在挖掘時更不容易意外破壞可疑的沙子和礫石。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"color:#f00\">!免責聲明!</span> 發光和連接功能需要&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252foptifine.net%252fdownloads\" rel=\"nofollow\">Optifine</a> 或任何功能相同的 CTM 移植版本。對於 Fabric 使用者，我推薦 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/continuity\" rel=\"nofollow\">Continuity</a>。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/985213811055263834/1126099301903388672/2023-07-05_05.18.27.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1845\" height=\"1038\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/985213811055263834/1126099302998097980/2023-07-05_05.26.41.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1845\" height=\"1038\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/985213811055263834/1126099302226346045/2023-07-05_05.19.01.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1845\" height=\"1038\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/985213811055263834/1126099302599630938/2023-07-05_05.21.44.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1845\" height=\"1038\"></span></p>",
